  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU-kunskap f&#xF6;r journal II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-training for journ II - EU-knowledge for journ II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training for Turkish journalists. The aim is to contribute to the democratic process in Turkey through improved professionalism of journalists. The objective is to contribute to discerning and balanced reporting on EU in the Turkish media. During 2002-04 10 seminars on EU for 25 journalists will be implemented. Turkish part: Turkish Journalist Association, Swedish part: Fojo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning i EU-kunskap f&#xF6;r turkiska journalister. Syftet &#xE4;r att bidra till den demokratiska utvecklingen i Turkiet genom att &#xF6;ka professionaliteten bland journalister samt att bidra till en mer nyanserad och insatt behandling av EU i turkiska media. Utbildning drivs av svenska FOJO i Kalmar i samarbete med turkiska journalistorganisationen.</narrative>
  </description>
